{
  "texts": [
    {
      "content": "are spiny, cactus-like protrusions that emit bursts of radiation to deter nearby threats.\nThough they appear as isolated organisms, each is merely the surface node\n of a vast parasitic mycelium network buried underground",
      "left": "172.075px",
      "top": "267.8px",
      "scale": "1.4000000000000004",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Atop each stalk sits a mobile eye capable of slow, deliberate rotation.\n These ocular organs not only detect movement but emit hypnotic bioluminescent\n flashes that can disorient or briefly paralyze nearby fauna.",
      "left": "644.8px",
      "top": "719px",
      "scale": "1.4000000000000004",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Cacteye",
      "left": "471.2px",
      "top": "97.0125px",
      "scale": "6.199999999999995",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Their growth is sparse and deliberately\nspaced,suggesting a territorial strategy\nbased on isolated control zones.",
      "left": "571px",
      "top": "472.2px",
      "scale": "1.4000000000000004",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Sensory data is relayed to the central\n mycelial core,which coordinates\ndefensive responses with precision.",
      "left": "651.4px",
      "top": "934.5px",
      "scale": "1.4000000000000004",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "When agitated, the stalks writhe in rhythmic,\nalmost choreographedmotion-an eerie\ndisplay that resembles a convulsive dance.",
      "left": "607.8px",
      "top": "1164.6px",
      "scale": "1.4000000000000004",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    },
    {
      "content": "This movement appears to serve both as a deterrent and a formofintra-network\nsignaling, though its exact function remains poorly understood.",
      "left": "224.888px",
      "top": "1380.4px",
      "scale": "1.4000000000000004",
      "rotate": "0",
      "fontFamily": "melonfruit",
      "fontSize": "28px",
      "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)"
    }
  ],
